     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : CarteDeConcepts FRLegalAuthenticationLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"FRLegalAuthenticationLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"hcFRLegalAuthenticationLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Groupe 1 </b>Mapping de <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document-core/StructureDefinition/FRLMLegalAuthentication</code> to <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-legal-authenticator.html\">CDA - legalAuthenticatorversion : 0.1.0)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMLegalAuthentication</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>LegalAuthenticator</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMLegalAuthentication.dateTime</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>LegalAuthenticator.time (Date et heure de la prise de responsabilité)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMLegalAuthentication.legalAuthenticator[x]</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>LegalAuthenticator.assignedEntity (Responsable du document)</td><td>Cas où legalAuthenticator[x] référence un FRLMHealthProfessional, cf. FRHealthProfessionalLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMLegalAuthentication.legalAuthenticator[x]</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>LegalAuthenticator.assignedEntity (Responsable du document)</td><td>Cas où legalAuthenticator[x] référence un FRLMPatient (document d'expression personnelle), cf. FRPatientLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMLegalAuthentication.legalAuthenticator[x]</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>LegalAuthenticator.assignedEntity (Responsable du document)</td><td>Cas où legalAuthenticator[x] référence un FRLMDevice, cf. FRDeviceLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMLegalAuthentication.legalAuthenticator[x]</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>LegalAuthenticator.assignedEntity (Responsable du document)</td><td>Cas où legalAuthenticator[x] référence un FRLMOrganisation (ex : Dossier Pharmaceutique), cf. FROrganisationLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Groupe 2 </b>Mapping de <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document-core/StructureDefinition/FRLMLegalAuthentication</code> to <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-fhir-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-composition-document.html\">FR Composition Documentversion : 0.1.0)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMLegalAuthentication</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Composition.attester (Attests to accuracy of composition)</td><td>attester.where(mode='legal')</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMLegalAuthentication.dateTime</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Composition.attester.time (When the composition was attested)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMLegalAuthentication.legalAuthenticator[x]</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Composition.attester.party (Who attested the composition)</td><td>Cas où legalAuthenticator[x] référence un FRLMHealthProfessional (attester.party.resolve().ofType(PractitionerRole)) — cf. FRHealthProfessionalLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMLegalAuthentication.legalAuthenticator[x]</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Composition.attester.party (Who attested the composition)</td><td>Cas où legalAuthenticator[x] référence un FRLMPatient (attester.party.resolve().ofType(Patient)) — cf. FRPatientLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMLegalAuthentication.legalAuthenticator[x]</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Composition.attester.party (Who attested the composition)</td><td>Cas où legalAuthenticator[x] référence un FRLMDevice (attester.party.resolve().ofType(Device)) — cf. FRDeviceLMCDAFHIR (composant commun).</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMLegalAuthentication.legalAuthenticator[x]</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Composition.attester.party (Who attested the composition)</td><td>Cas où legalAuthenticator[x] référence un FRLMOrganisation (attester.party.resolve().ofType(Organization)) — cf. FROrganisationLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr></table></div>"
